  "title": "Pecan Delight",
  "description": "Egg whites are whipped until stiff, and then pecans, crushed buttery crackers, sugar, vanilla, and baking powder are gently folded in. This yummy filling is then spooned into a prepared pie tin and baked. Top with whipped topping and serve.",
